Research Graph browser runtime
------------------------------

The Business OS Web Research graph surface includes a locally bundled ESM
closure rooted at 3d-force-graph, three.js, and three-spritetext. The closure
is used only from `src/apps/business-os/vendor/research-graph.mjs` and has no
runtime package-manager or CDN dependency. Exact versions, source URLs,
integrity hashes, and component license texts are recorded in
`src/apps/business-os/vendor/research-graph.provenance.json` and
`src/apps/business-os/vendor/research-graph.LICENSES.txt`.
